// Step 1: the value shape and a printer. Objects deliberately left out until the shape holds.

Define object jval with (the text kind, the number num, the text str, the series of jval items).

Pull a rabbit.
    Bind text to render, given (the jval v):
        If the kind of v is "null", return "null".
        If the kind of v is "true", return "true".
        If the kind of v is "false", return "false".
        If the kind of v is "num", return the num of v converted to text.
        If the kind of v is "str", return "\"" joined to the str of v joined to "\"".
        If the kind of v is "array":
            Define out as "[".
            Define leading as true.
            For each kid in the items of v, repeat:
                If leading is false, out becomes out joined to ",".
                out becomes out joined to Cast render on (kid).
                leading becomes false.
            Done.
            Return out joined to "]".
        Done.
        Return "?".
    Done.

    Define empty as a series of jval.
    Define n1 as a new jval { the kind "num", the num 1, the str "", the items empty }.
    Define s1 as a new jval { the kind "str", the num 0, the str "hi", the items empty }.
    Define arr as a new jval { the kind "array", the num 0, the str "", the items a series of jval with (n1, s1) }.

    State Cast render on (arr).
Done.
